Title: GeneList
Version: 1.1.0
Author: GeneList
Maintainer: GeneList <contact.genelist@gmail.com>
Description: Export a vector of gene identifiers to gene-list.com, which links
    each one to around forty research resources. Supports the 24 genomes
    available on the site, from human and mouse through to E. coli and
    Arabidopsis.
